# Bot2's Pest Infestation (X = 1) makes two Pest tokens ("when this token dies, you gain 1 life"). With no Rest in Peace out,
# Bot1's first Lightning Bolt kills a Pest: it dies and Bot2 gains 1 (21). Bot1 then casts Rest in Peace (its enters trigger
# exiles the graveyards) and Bolts the other Pest: a token would be put into a graveyard, so it is exiled instead
# (CR 614.1a) and never dies, and Bot2 stays at 21.

